The modular seed is the workshop layer of FNM v5.0. It allows new clusters to be accumulated and connected before the map is sealed as a historical architecture. Its value is therefore developmental and genealogical: it shows how the Paper Roses, Logotic Foundation, institutional, and room structures were gathered into the v5.0 system.

Version sequence:

- #356 — `FNM-SEED-5.0-alpha`, working accumulator;
- #364 — crystallized Fractal Navigation Map v5.0;
- later v5.3, v6, and v7 maps supersede the v5.0 state.
